  "description": "Gu Jae-ha, a delivery worker in a small rural village, is kidnapped and confined by Han Seo-young, his first love from the past.\nSeo-young demands the recipe for the pasta Jae-ha made seven years ago, the one she remembers as the most delicious in the world.\nWill the two of them be able to rediscover the taste of their first love?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Aladin Tobe](https://tobe.aladin.co.kr/s/10069), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=379511334)",
